Machine-local files for dev builds (this folder is gitignored):
  wifi.env  - Wi-Fi network dev images join (see wifi.env.example). Written to
              the data partition, so it survives updates. Stopgap until the
              setup hotspot exists; on an already-flashed card use
              sudo tools/set-wifi.sh /media/$USER/data instead.
  rauc/     - dev update signing key, generated on first build. Back it up:
              dev devices only accept updates signed with it.
